OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think I'd pass':
OL,4,AStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,5,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of students have
OL,8,Fopened their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,9,FNationals results in England, Wales and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland
OL,12,FThe overall pass rate has fallen
OL,13,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,14,Fbut top grades have edged up across all
OL,15,Fthree nations, as the regional gap in
OL,16,FEngland has widened
OL,18,FAspiring dancer Finn "didn't think
OL,19,F[he'd] pass everything", while Nasser,
OL,20,Fwho's fled the war in Sudan, says
OL,21,Fpassing his maths and English GCSEs is
OL,22,Fone of his "proudest moments"
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
