OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think I'd pass':
OL,4,AStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,5,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FChildhood best friends Jessie and Ellie
OL,8,Fare relieved with their grades,
OL,9,Fthanking their "amazing teacher, Miss
OL,10,FEvie", as Isla says she's "smashed" her
OL,11,Fresults and is celebrating with a
OL,12,Ffamily trip to Ibiza
OL,14,FNot everyone getting their results is a
OL,15,Fteenager - with 52-year-old grandmother
OL,16,FWynne and Joanne, 56, both passing
OL,17,Ftheir maths exam
OL,19,FOur team of experts have been answering
OL,20,Fyour questions - giving advice on
OL,21,Fthings like getting your paper remarked
OL,22,Fand if you don't have a plan yet
